<title>USA: Norris, Voice It end pact.</title>
<headline>Norris, Voice It end pact.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norris Communications Inc and Voice It Worldwide Inc on Wednesday said they mutually agreed not to pursue a letter of intent under which Voice It would have sold Norris products under the Voice It name.</p>
<p>The agreement was announced on Dec. 6, 1996.</p>
